{%- comment -%}
  lb-hero-lcp-preload.liquid
  Version:      4.0.0
  Last updated: 2026-08-21
  Status:       Intentionally no-op.

  The homepage hero already owns LCP preloading inside sections/hero.liquid.
  That implementation uses Shopify's preload_tag and mirrors the exact image
  widths/sizes selected by the rendered hero branch. Keeping a second, head-
  level preload path here caused duplicate high-priority image discovery and
  could make Chrome download competing desktop/mobile candidates.

  This compatibility snippet remains because layout/theme.liquid renders it.
  Rendering nothing preserves that call site while establishing a single
  source of truth for hero LCP preloading: sections/hero.liquid.

  Do not re-introduce manual homepage hero <link rel="preload"> tags here
  unless the section-level preload mechanism is removed in the same release.
{%- endcomment -%}
